    "blogtextliquid_LBJgtB": {
      "type": "editorial--blog-text-liquid",
      "custom_css": [],
      "name": "Blog Text Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "text_content": "<p>Buying a gift for a man can feel like negotiating with someone who refuses to name a ransom. You ask what he wants, and you get a shrug, 'I don't know, socks?' or a request for something so hyper-specific it requires an engineering degree to purchase.</p><p>Fragrance is the classic solution, but most people default to the same three safe designer colognes you can smell in every gym locker room and elevator in the country. If the man you are shopping for takes pride in having his own distinct style, generic blue cologne simply will not cut it.</p>"
      }
    },
