    "blogtextliquid_ra7Awx": {
      "type": "editorial--blog-text-liquid",
      "custom_css": [],
      "name": "Blog Text Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "text_content": "<p>Some guys wear the same three colognes as everyone else and never question it. But for the guy who has strong opinions, values craftsmanship, and likes to stand apart, you need a scent with character.</p><p>A great men's fragrance should feel tailored, unexpected, and intriguing. It should make people lean in and ask, 'What are you wearing?' instead of recognizing it immediately from a billboard. Here is how to pick the right bottle for his unique persona.</p>"
      }
    },
    "blocks_ji7beH": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "blog_editorial_text_section_zNd6WG": {
          "type": "blog--editorial-text-section",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "The Crowd-Pleasing Blue Cologne vs The Niche Statement",
            "heading_size": 42,
            "heading_size_mobile": 28,
            "heading_line_height": 1.1,
            "heading_color": "#1A1816",
            "heading_margin_bottom": 30,
            "heading_margin_bottom_mobile": 25,
            "column_1_text": "<p>Standard department store colognes rely heavily on the 'blue' fragrance template: aquatic citrus, synthetic lavender, and fresh shower-gel ambroxan. They are safe, clean, and completely ubiquitous.</p><p>While there is nothing wrong with smelling clean, it leaves zero lasting impression. It says, 'I bought whatever was on the front display table.'</p>",
            "column_2_text": "<p>A niche-inspired statement fragrance introduces texture and tension: smoky pineapple, dry oakmoss, rich patchouli, or powdery iris and leather.</p><p>These scents signal intentionality and refined taste. They project an aura of confidence, creative sophistication, and mature masculine authority.</p>",
            "body_size": 17,
            "body_size_mobile": 15,
            "body_line_height": 1.9,
            "body_color": "#2D2A26",
            "paragraph_spacing": 20,
            "column_gap": 55,
            "column_gap_mobile": 30,
            "max_width": 1100,
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "background_color": "#FAF8F5",
            "padding_top": 60,
            "padding_bottom": 60,
            "padding_horizontal": 40,
            "padding_top_mobile": 40,
            "padding_bottom_mobile": 40,
            "padding_horizontal_mobile": 20
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "blog_editorial_text_section_zNd6WG"
      ],
      "name": "Editorial text section",
      "settings": {}
    },
    "1778690749e24fd023": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "blog_narrative_content_9nTtAA": {
          "type": "blog--narrative-content",
          "settings": {
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "max_width": 1100,
            "section_padding": 60,
            "background_color": "#FAF8F5",
            "heading": "<p>Eternal Verde & Mirage: for the man of distinction</p>",
            "heading_size": 42,
            "heading_color": "#1A1816",
            "heading_spacing": 25,
            "box_color": "#1C1917",
            "box_radius": 15,
            "box_padding": 45,
            "box_spacing": 35,
            "box_paragraph_1": "<p>For the guy who truly likes to be different, <strong>Eternal Verde</strong> (inspired by Hacivat by Nishane) is our highest recommendation. Opening with juicy bergamot and pineapple smoke, it transitions into cedarwood, patchouli, and clean oakmoss. It is crisp, intriguing, and lasts over 12 hours.</p><p>If he prefers tailored elegance, <strong>Mirage</strong> combines delicate iris with smooth leather and sandalwood—the olfactory equivalent of a bespoke tailored suit.</p><p>And for the man who fills a doorway with charismatic confidence, <strong>Fierce</strong> (inspired by Sauvage Parfum) delivers bold bergamot and spicy ambroxan that never misses.</p>",
            "box_paragraph_2": "",
            "box_paragraph_3": "",
            "box_text_color": "#F5EFE6",
            "box_text_size": 17,
            "box_text_line_height": 1.9,
            "paragraph_spacing": 20,
            "subheading": "<p>The one you are still getting to know: Silk Odyssey</p>",
            "subheading_size": 42,
            "subheading_color": "#1A1816",
            "subheading_spacing": 40,
            "bottom_text": "<p>If you are shopping for a coworker, a brother-in-law, or someone you are still getting to know, <strong>Silk Odyssey</strong> (inspired by Oud Satin Mood) is an exquisite dark horse. The blend of velvety vanilla, violet, and smooth oud smells undeniably opulent and unforgettable.</p><p>A thoughtful fragrance lands so well because it is something he would rarely buy for himself.</p>",
            "bottom_text_size": 17,
            "bottom_text_color": "#2D2A26",
            "bottom_text_line_height": 1.9
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "blog_narrative_content_9nTtAA"
      ],
      "settings": {}
    },
