            "left_column_width": 45,
            "right_column_width": 55,
            "column_gap": 50,
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "heading": "What this means when you are shopping",
            "heading_font": "serif",
            "heading_size": 42,
            "mobile_heading_size": 28,
            "heading_color": "#1A1816",
            "heading_indent": 0,
            "mobile_heading_indent": 0,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/ChatGPT_Image_Jul_13_2026_05_48_11_PM.png",
            "image_max_width": 500,
            "heading_image_gap": 16,
            "mobile_heading_image_gap": 20,
            "body_text": "<p>When gifting cologne to a man, reassure him on how to apply it: two to three sprays on the neck and chest are plenty. A great cologne should be discovered, not announced.</p><p>Each Scentspired bottle arrives in a bespoke presentation box, giving him the complete luxury unboxing experience at an accessible price.</p>",
